<title>HONG KONG: CIBC CEF launches First Pacific warrants.</title>
<headline>CIBC CEF launches First Pacific warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, London branch, said on Tuesday it issued 280 million American-style call warrants on shares of First Pacific Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$10.0225	 PREMIUM	 15.5 PCT</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$0.2163	  GEARING	 4.88X</p>
<p> MATURITY	    27.MAY.98	  MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$10.55</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
